            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DIANASMOM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I substituted instant cheesecake pudding (Jello brand) for pistachio and it was even better. I also used a little of the pineapple juice from the can to make it creamier. Try it!",
            "datePublished": "2004-03-02T11:40:32.107Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
