            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a Family favorite! \nI do not drain the pineapple and I add a 1/2 Cup of Chopped Pecans and a small jar of drained maraschino Cherries. ?? at Christmas I’ll use red and green cherries and it’s so pretty &amp; delicious!",
