              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cyndi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So easy and yummy. A nice, cool dessert for summer and takes me right back to childhood! We called it green glop. My family adds chopped pecans to the recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2026-07-27T17:14:16.333Z"
          },
