            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Aunt Helen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I like everything about this salad, but I cube up, small size, one large apple (whatever crisp, tart apple available) and fold it into the salad. I sprinkle lightly salted chopped pistachios on top. I sometimes add Marchino cherries, as well. This is one of the most decadent salads ever made. It is so versatile. This is a must have at any large gatherings.",
